# Line-ending normalization for cross-platform development (macOS <-> Windows 11).
#
# Every sketch/library source and shell script is stored as LF in the repo AND
# checked out as LF on every platform, Windows included. This keeps diffs clean
# and keeps run.sh (the header host-test) working. `text=auto` detects any
# binary that lands here and leaves it untouched.

* text=auto eol=lf

# The host-test runner: always LF, never CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Compiled Arduino / test artifacts, if any ever escape .gitignore.
*.hex binary
*.bin binary
*.elf binary
